    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class of cleanup handler that controls recovery of resources of the given type. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Derived</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Class that uses this class as a base. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_type" kindref="compound">Type</ref> of controlled resource.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
This class serves as a base for its template parameter as implied by Curiously Recurring Template <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_pattern" kindref="compound">Pattern</ref>.</para>
<para>This class factors out creation of a cleanup handler. The latter requires knowledge of the current recovery context, which is provided by this class. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
